This <University of Oxford> Part C paper is cross-listed for Mathematics, Mathematics and Computer Science, and Mathematics and Philosophy. Section A concerns <topology>, and section B concerns <set theory>. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Source release]{ref} The archive contains the complete editable four-page transcription, with the source closure bars checked against the scan. Bounded official-source searches found no advertised answers to this exact paper. All source leaves and unnumbered preliminary tasks are covered below.

